# Local-only DEV loader. This checkout lives in a codename folder "EyesUpDev" so a live
# CurseForge "EyesUp" install can sit beside it. WoW needs the .toc name to match the folder,
# so EyesUpDev.toc is a near-copy of EyesUp.toc with a "[DEV]" Title and its own EyesUpDev*
# SavedVariables (Core.lua switches to them when the Title has "[DEV]"). Not committed — the
# repo/zip stay EyesUp-only. Regenerate after editing EyesUp.toc with:
#   pwsh tools/make-dev-toc.ps1
/EyesUpDev.toc

# Build output.
/dist/
